tcg: the translated-code buffer lives in memory a savestate does not carry

Every byte of it is derived from guest memory the state does carry, and 215
MB of a 316 MB Prince of Persia state was this buffer - translations of code
the machine had run since boot, kept because the buffer is never flushed until
it fills. In the chimera guest it is allocated from the sandbox's invisible
arena, so it is in no savestate and in no greenzone delta; the driver flushes
every translation when a state is loaded (StateLoaded, ui/xemu-waterbox.c),
and the machine re-translates what it runs from the memory it was given,
exactly as it did the first time. The regions are still made RWX and guarded
by tcg_region_init as before.

diff --git a/tcg/region.c b/tcg/region.c
index 2181267..c9d03a3 100644
--- a/tcg/region.c
+++ b/tcg/region.c
@@ -688,6 +688,29 @@ static int alloc_code_gen_buffer(size_t size, int splitwx, Error **errp)
     ERRP_GUARD();
     int prot, flags;
 
+#ifdef CHIMERA_GUEST
+    /*
+     * CHIMERA: the translated code lives in memory a savestate does not
+     * carry. Every byte of it is derived from guest memory the state does
+     * carry, and 215 MB of a 316 MB Prince of Persia state was this buffer.
+     * So it comes from the sandbox's invisible arena, and the driver flushes
+     * every translation when a state is loaded (StateLoaded in
+     * ui/xemu-waterbox.c): the machine then re-translates what it runs, from
+     * the memory it was given, exactly as it did the first time.
+     */
+    if (splitwx <= 0) {
+        extern void *alloc_invisible(size_t);
+        void *buf = alloc_invisible(size);
+        if (buf == NULL) {
+            error_setg(errp, "allocate %zu bytes of invisible memory for the jit buffer", size);
+            return -1;
+        }
+        region.start_aligned = buf;
+        region.total_size = size;
+        return PROT_READ | PROT_WRITE;   /* the regions are made RWX below */
+    }
+#endif
+
     if (splitwx) {
         prot = alloc_code_gen_buffer_splitwx(size, errp);
         if (prot >= 0) {
